; A supersession which holds together, twice over. The vertex carries a chain
; three links long — scaled off a plan, shot once, shot again — and the room
; carries two estimates which one as-built check replaced between them.
;
; Nothing here is a mistake. Every deprecated claim names what stands in its
; place, following those names reaches a claim which is still asserted, and the
; claims which were replaced are still in the file saying what was believed.
(vertex geom:V-02
  (frame frame:building)
  (position
